ressively kill legacy gateway path to cut on-call burden (Marcus's call). • Cardinal-specific integrations: maintain through contracted SLA; consolidate after. • Design-system rewrite: deferred to Q4 or later. • Sarah's senior-staff promo case timing: discuss Thursday — Maya: case is about impact, not macro, but optics of timing matter. — Action items — • Marcus Webb — land rate-limiter translation-layer PR after Sarah's review (tomorrow). • Sarah Kim — leave PR comment on uppercase-legacy-customer-ID key derivation; complete review. • Maya Lin — bump SRE leadership on staging-cluster flakiness; send Priya the intern end-of-program review form. • Diana Park — send May on-call rotation in Slack tonight; review Priya's Grafana alert thresholds Thursday 11:00. • Marcus / Sarah / Diana — incident retro action items targeting end of next week. • Maya Lin — submit intern return-offer recs to Bob by May 30; share Q3 planning doc with the four full-time attendees tomorrow. Please keep this summary and the related discussions confidential within the full-time team. Best, Maya Lin To: maya.lin@northstar.io, diana.park@northstar.io, marcus.webb@northstar.io, sarah.kim@northstar.io

